          "index": 15,
          "text": "Sixers stars Harden and Embiid became the first pair of teammates to win the assist and scoring titles, respectively, since former San Antonio Spurs legends George Gervin and Johnny Moore did so in 1981-82. Despite Embiid winning his first Kia MVP, the Sixers came up short in the playoffs, blowing a 3-2 lead to the Celtics in the conference semis.",
