        {
          "index": 8,
          "text": "The trade deadline provided plenty of excitement around the NBA as well as a number of All-Star players shifted locales for the season’s stretch run and playoffs. The Lakers pulled off a stunning trade in landing Memphis Grizzlies superstar and All-Star big man Pau Gasol. Other teams in the West kept up in the arms race with the Lakers, too: the Mavericks swung a trade that brought Jason Kidd back to Dallas, while Phoenix dealt Shawn Marion to the Heat for O’Neal.",
          "links": [],
          "html": "The trade deadline provided plenty of excitement around the NBA as well as a number of All-Star players shifted locales for the season’s stretch run and playoffs. The Lakers pulled off a stunning trade in landing Memphis Grizzlies superstar and All-Star big man Pau Gasol. Other teams in the West kept up in the arms race with the Lakers, too: the Mavericks swung a trade that brought Jason Kidd back to Dallas, while Phoenix dealt Shawn Marion to the Heat for O’Neal."
