          "text": "In the playoffs, the spry Hawks gave the Celtics all it could handle in the first round, pushing it to a Game 7 (which Boston won by a landslide). Also in the first round, the Cavs won a chippy series against the Wizards, while the Magic and Pistons made it look easy. Boston and Cleveland waged a classic series in the East semis in which Boston’s other veterans (James Posey, P.J. Brown and others) delivered in a Game 7 win. After that, Boston dropped Detroit in Game 6 to reach its first Finals since 1987.",
